  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb — follows standard -IR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *sufrido* (regular)",
    "Means \"to suffer\" or \"to undergo\" — *sufrir una enfermedad* (to suffer an illness), *sufrir un cambio* (to undergo a change)",
    "*Sufrir de* + noun = to suffer from (a condition): *sufre de insomnio* (he/she suffers from insomnia)",
    "Related: *sufrimiento* (suffering), *sufrido/a* (long-suffering, worn/faded — depending on context)"
